	"description": {
		"ja": [
			"無限のカスタマイズで自分だけの量産機を作り出せ!!!!!",
			"シンプルな構造で組み立てが簡単なBANDAI SPIRITSオリジナルロボットプラモデルシリーズ「30 MINUTES MISSIONS」より、大空翔ける天空の機体「eEXM-17 アルト(空中戦仕様）」が1/144スケールで登場！",
			"• 翼部分に様々な可動ギミックを搭載！細かく分割するパーツでカスタマイズの幅がさらに拡大し、ポルタノヴァにも装着可能！",
			"• バックパックに装着できるキャノン砲はライフルとしても使用可能！",
			"• 機体色と合わせたネイビーのマルチブースターユニットが付属。"
		],
		"en": [
			"Create your own mass-produced machine with unlimited customization!!!!!",
			"From the BANDAI SPIRITS original robot plastic model series \"30 MINUTES MISSIONS\" with a simple structure and easy assembly, the celestial aircraft \"eEXM-17 Alto (air combat specification)\" that can fly in the sky is now available in 1/144 Scale!",
			"• Equipped with various movable gimmicks on the wings! The range of customization is further expanded with parts that can be divided into small pieces, and it can also be installed on Portanova!",
			"• The cannon that can be attached to the backpack can also be used as a rifle!",
			"• Comes with a navy multi-booster unit that matches the aircraft color."
		]
	},
